{"seq":3,"slug":"trial-and-death","title":"Trial And Death","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-trial","title":"审判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-trial","wordCount":1960,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-death","title":"从容赴死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-death","wordCount":2059,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章记述苏格拉底一生的高潮与终点——审判与死亡。公元前399年，苏格拉底被以&quot;不敬神&quot;&quot;败坏青年&quot;的罪名提起公诉。本章呈现他在法庭上不卑不亢的申辩、有罪的判决、狱中拒绝越狱的抉择，以及最终从容饮鸩、平静赴死的崇高一幕，揭示苏格拉底之死作为为信念而殉道的永恒意义。</p>\n"}